@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<body>
    <div id="homebanner" class="fullwidth">
        <h1>Event Parking</h1>
        <div id="search">
            <form action="/EventSearch" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Search events by name or location">
                <label for="search-input" class="visually-hidden">
                    Search events by name or location
                </label>
                <input type="search"
                       id="search-input"
                       name="query"
                       placeholder="Search an Event by Name or Location..."
                       required />
                <button type="submit">Search</button>
            </form>

        </div>
<div> <P>Locating a parking spot even before you reserve your events motivates you even more not to fail to attend not only yourself but with your family as well. 
The events could range from basketball, football, concert, musicals etc.
 Name it we have the parking spot for you.  
 </P> </div>
    </div>
    <div id="support" class="fullwidth">
        <div id="broll" class="supportsection">
            <img src="~/logo_300x300.png" />
        </div>
        <div>
            <h1>Search Parkwhiz Venues</h1>

            <form method="get" asp-page="/API/ParkwhizVenue1" class="row g-2 align-items-center">
                <div class="col-auto">
                    <label class="form-label visually-hidden" for="Lat">Latitude</label>
                    <input id="Lat" name="Lat" class="form-control" placeholder="Latitude (e.g. 39.103100)" value="39.103100" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                    <label class="form-label visually-hidden" for="Lon">Longitude</label>
                    <input id="Lon" name="Lon" class="form-control" placeholder="Longitude (e.g. -84.512000)" value="-84.512000" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Search</button>
                </div>
            </form>

            <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Enter GPS coordinates and press Search. You'll be taken to the Parkwhiz Venues page with the coordinates in the URL.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
